ing to anyone in  addition to many shrek comparisons some  fans also disliked the super aaron's  looks as many had hoped for a more  muscular or fearsome portrayal as cgi  artist sean rookcroft confirmed she was  initially designed to be more muscular  but was then given her current much  slimmer form however this could not be  that big of a deal since it keeps the  character very close to the comic books  which is definitely not the case with  other disney films like the little  mermaid as has often been the subject of  criticism in the past but not only the  fans are critical of the new she-hulk  series an insider also claims to have  heard nothing good as matthew baloney  reported to puck. news she-hulk is  destined to be a big flop baloney  already referred to various sources  behind the scenes last march who are not  too confident about the release of the  series in addition to teddy anna  misslania she-hulk and mark ruffalo's  hulk the cast also includes tim roth as  the villain abomination jamila jamil as  titania and benedict wrong as well wong  behind the scenes kat koiro and anuvalia  both directed while jessica gao wrote  the script so far the mcu project has  unfortunately not been well received and  it remains to be seen whether at least  the visual flaws will be corrected by  the time this series premieres on disney  plus on august 17 2022  recently after a long wait the second  trailer for thor love and thunder was  finally released in it we can at last  take a look at the big highlight of the  mcu blockbuster we are talking about  thor's exposed butt and the loki easter  egg but about christian balin is already  terrifying an equally promising role as  gore the butcher for another look at  gore check out the new poster that was  released this past tuesday which also  features other important characters by  the way in an interview with total film  director taika waititi also talked about  the fourth thor movie there he was asked  how closely thor love