ady been cast margot roby  is said to act not only as the main  character but also as a producer further  details are still scarce but it seems  likely that the original 1960 film and  the ocean's 11 remake are somehow  connected in las vegas danny ocean and  his team go on a foray and in europe  margot robbie's character and her  colleagues however this has not been  confirmed yet which is why we can only  make assumptions about it at this point  in time in charge of directing his  austin powers director jay roach this  script will be written by newcomer  carrie sullivan shooting of the warner  brothers film is scheduled to start at  the beginning of next year which is why  release before 2024 is considered  unlikely so far it is not known when the  new garfield movie starring chris pratt  will be released the plot of the  upcoming animated movie is also still  unknown but instead the next top class  addition to the cast has already been  announced we are referring to hollywood  legend samuel l jackson who is to take  on the role of garfield's father vic  this role was created specifically for  the new film but no further details have  been revealed by those responsible yet  chicken little director mark dindle will  be in charge of directing the movie  which will be adapted from a screenplay  by david reynolds among other projects  reynolds has previously worked on  disney's tarzan and finding nemo and is  by no means new to the animated film  business  we will keep you posted as soon as we  know more about the release date or some  initial plot information  this week we can offer you many brand  new trailers on our channel including  thor love and thunder and mission  impossible 7. in addition you can look  forward to a new original for shazam  fury of the gods there you will learn  everything you need to know about the  much anticipated dc movie  [Music]  foreign

